      m_Calls: []
  m_text: "Ghouldon Ramsey: \u201CClick to cut the worms, chef! Yes, worms! The key
    ingredient to your miserable little dish! Try not to butcher it completely. keep
    that accuracy above 25%, or I\u2019ll start wondering if you\u2019re cooking
    with your eyes closed. And slice at least 50 of the wriggly freaks, or dinner\u2019s
    off and you\u2019re on the menu!\u201D"
